<div class="fm-page">
  <section id="hero" class="fm-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="fm-hero-content">
      <p class="fm-role">SOFTWARE ENGINEER</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title" class="fm-name">Igor Cheliadinski</h1>
      <p class="fm-tagline">Frontend-focused full-stack engineer with a systems and architecture mindset.</p>
      <nav class="fm-hero-links" aria-label="Hero links">
        <a href="#projects">View Work</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
        <a href="#contact">Get in Touch</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <a href="#timeline" class="fm-scroll-down">
      {% lucide "chevronDown" %}
      <span class="fm-visually-hidden">Scroll to career journey</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section id="timeline" class="fm-section" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
    <div class="fm-container">
      <header class="fm-section-head fm-reveal">
        <h2 id="timeline-title">Career Journey</h2>
        <p>Building digital products and engineering systems since 2014</p>
      </header>

      <div class="fm-timeline-shell">
        <span class="fm-timeline-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="fm-timeline-progress" data-timeline-progress aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <ol class="fm-timeline" data-timeline>
          <li class="fm-timeline-item fm-timeline-item-left fm-reveal">
            <div class="fm-timeline-copy">
              <p class="fm-year">2023</p>
              <h3>Principal Engineer</h3>
              <p>Contributing to a membership and learning platform by shipping product improvements with strong maintainability and delivery quality.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="fm-timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </li>

          <li class="fm-timeline-item fm-timeline-item-right fm-reveal">
            <div class="fm-timeline-copy">
              <p class="fm-year">2021</p>
              <h3>Lead Software Engineer</h3>
              <p>Delivered frontend and full-stack solutions for Fortune 500 clients, with emphasis on architecture decisions and long-term product stability.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="fm-timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </li>

          <li class="fm-timeline-item fm-timeline-item-left fm-reveal">
            <div class="fm-timeline-copy">
              <p class="fm-year">2017</p>
              <h3>Senior Software Engineer</h3>
              <p>Worked on user-facing web products in a high-scale digital entertainment context with focus on responsiveness and UX quality.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="fm-timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </li>

          <li class="fm-timeline-item fm-timeline-item-right fm-reveal">
            <div class="fm-timeline-copy">
              <p class="fm-year">2014</p>
              <h3>Software Engineer</h3>
              <p>Started engineering career building robust web interfaces and learning how to balance product goals with technical constraints.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="fm-timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="fm-section" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
    <div class="fm-container">
      <header class="fm-section-head fm-reveal">
        <h2 id="projects-title">Selected Work</h2>
        <p>Projects spanning product engineering, frontend architecture, and systems thinking</p>
      </header>

      <div class="fm-grid fm-grid-two">
        <article class="fm-card fm-project-card fm-reveal">
          <div class="fm-project-card-head">
            <h3>Electives AI Simulations</h3>
            <a href="https://www.electives.io/ai-simulations" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fm-project-link">
              <span class="fm-project-link-text">Visit site</span>
              <span class="fm-project-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "squareArrowOutUpRight" %}</span>
              <span class="fm-visually-hidden"> for Electives AI Simulations (opens in a new tab)</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>Built AI-powered workplace simulations that let learners practice realistic conversations, get live coaching, and repeat tailored scenarios for stronger on-the-job performance.</p>
          <ul class="fm-tags">
            <li>React</li>
            <li>TypeScript</li>
            <li>Product Engineering</li>
            <li>Voice AI</li>
            <li>Conversational UX</li>
            <li>Realtime Systems</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="fm-card fm-project-card fm-reveal">
          <div class="fm-project-card-head">
            <h3>AR Virtual Try-On (Web)</h3>
            <a href="#contact" class="fm-project-link">
              <span class="fm-project-link-text">Ask about it</span>
              <span class="fm-project-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "squareArrowOutUpRight" %}</span>
              <span class="fm-visually-hidden"> for AR Virtual Try-On (Web)</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>Built web-based AR try-on experiences for a global beauty brand, including eyeshadow and lipstick features that used the device camera for responsive, realistic cosmetic previews.</p>
          <ul class="fm-tags">
            <li>Three.js</li>
            <li>TensorFlow.js</li>
            <li>MediaPipe</li>
            <li>WebAssembly</li>
            <li>WebGL</li>
            <li>Vector Graphics</li>
            <li>Computer Vision</li>
            <li>TypeScript</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="fm-card fm-project-card fm-reveal">
          <div class="fm-project-card-head">
            <h3>Enterprise Web Platforms</h3>
            <a href="https://www.epam.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fm-project-link">
              <span class="fm-project-link-text">Visit site</span>
              <span class="fm-project-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "squareArrowOutUpRight" %}</span>
              <span class="fm-visually-hidden"> for Enterprise Web Platforms (opens in a new tab)</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>Built and optimized large-scale web platforms for Fortune 500 teams in finance and e-commerce, while leading distributed engineering teams and partnering with stakeholders to deliver reliable production systems.</p>
          <ul class="fm-tags">
            <li>React</li>
            <li>Angular</li>
            <li>Node.js</li>
            <li>Performance Optimization</li>
            <li>Web Accessibility</li>
            <li>CI/CD</li>
            <li>Frontend Architecture</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="fm-card fm-project-card fm-reveal">
          <div class="fm-project-card-head">
            <h3>Accessible E-Commerce Checkout</h3>
            <a href="#contact" class="fm-project-link">
              <span class="fm-project-link-text">Ask about it</span>
              <span class="fm-project-link-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "squareArrowOutUpRight" %}</span>
              <span class="fm-visually-hidden"> for Accessible E-Commerce Checkout</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>Built advanced accessibility improvements for a high-traffic e-commerce checkout, targeting WCAG AAA with robust external keyboard support on mobile and tablet devices, screen reader compatibility, and accessible validation.</p>
          <ul class="fm-tags">
            <li>React</li>
            <li>TypeScript</li>
            <li>Web Accessibility</li>
            <li>Semantic HTML</li>
            <li>ARIA</li>
            <li>Performance Optimization</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="writing" class="fm-section" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
    <div class="fm-container fm-narrow">
      <header class="fm-section-head fm-reveal">
        <h2 id="writing-title">Writing &amp; Notes</h2>
        <p>Ideas on systems, product engineering, and practical frontend work</p>
      </header>

      <ul class="fm-writing-list">
        {% for article in writing.articles %}
          <li class="fm-reveal">
            <a href="{{ article.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span>
                <strong>{{ article.title }}</strong>
                <small>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "calendar" %}</span>
                  {{ article.dateLabel }}
                  {% if article.detail %}
                    <i aria-hidden="true">•</i>
                    {{ article.detail }}
                  {% endif %}
                </small>
              </span>
              <span class="fm-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
              <span class="fm-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "arrowRight" %}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {% else %}
          <li class="fm-reveal">
            <a href="{{ site.writing.fallbackUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span>
                <strong>Latest writing on the blog</strong>
                <small>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "calendar" %}</span>
                  Updated regularly
                  <i aria-hidden="true">•</i>
                  Notes and articles
                </small>
              </span>
              <span class="fm-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
              <span class="fm-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% lucide "arrowRight" %}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="experiments" class="fm-section" aria-labelledby="experiments-title">
    <div class="fm-container fm-narrow">
      <header class="fm-section-head fm-reveal">
        <h2 id="experiments-title">Experiments</h2>
        <p>No public experiments at the moment</p>
      </header>

      <div class="fm-grid">
        <article class="fm-card fm-reveal">
          <h3>Nothing public yet</h3>
          <p>I’m still experimenting privately. When something is ready to share, it will show up here.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="fm-section fm-contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="fm-container fm-contact-wrap">
      <header class="fm-section-head fm-reveal">
        <h2 id="contact-title">Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>Open to interesting product and engineering conversations</p>
      </header>

      <p class="fm-contact-intro fm-reveal">
        I focus on outcomes, not stacks: turning constraints, context, and intent into software that is maintainable, predictable, and useful.
      </p>

      <ul class="fm-contact-list">
        <li class="fm-reveal">
          <a href="mailto:hi@igorcodes.dev">
            <span class="fm-contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              {% lucide "mail" %}
            </span>
            <span><small>Email</small><strong>hi@igorcodes.dev</strong></span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="fm-reveal">
          <a href="https://github.com/igorxciv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span class="fm-contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              {% lucide "github" %}
            </span>
            <span><small>GitHub</small><strong>github.com/igorxciv</strong><span class="fm-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="fm-reveal">
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/igorxciv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span class="fm-contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              {% lucide "linkedin" %}
            </span>
            <span><small>LinkedIn</small><strong>linkedin.com/in/igorxciv</strong><span class="fm-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="fm-reveal">
          <a href="https://t.me/igorxciv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span class="fm-contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              {% lucide "globe" %}
            </span>
            <span><small>Telegram</small><strong>t.me/igorxciv</strong><span class="fm-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="fm-footer">
    <div class="fm-container fm-footer-inner">
      <p>© {{ build.year }} {{ site.name }}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>
